    {
      "_id": "07ead32bfb7c40ba",
      "name": "Lore Reference: What Tallis Knows",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>What Tallis Knows</h2><p>[ASK] The \"sealed\" service door behind the dusty terminal has opened for one minute at the same hour <strong>forty-one times</strong>. Someone keeps its rune working. A bell rang where none should.</p><p><strong>He does not know:</strong> Cladis, the claim, the method, or the Thaw. He has no secret role. He reads audits, so a Reconciliation Audit (T5) puts the claim in front of him.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
