    {
      "_id": "f1b1e31e2033ffed",
      "name": "GM Reference: If Tallis Posts",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/sundries/documents/document-sealed-red-yellow.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<h2>If Tallis Posts (Part 7.6)</h2><ul><li>The cold door is sealed by Exchange order. The party walks the long way (the Pilgrim Road).</li><li>Sabeline's contract is reviewed: contracted staff can't be bought or harmed, but she can be reassigned to a day desk with no access to the custody ledger.</li><li>The Exchange cannot arrest anyone outside its thresholds. It closes accounts and doors. That is all, and it is enough.</li><li>Public notices are read by everyone with an account, including people who report to the Regarder. A notice about \"a sealed door to the mountain road\" tells them where to look.</li><li>After a notice, the Haywards patrol the mountain road too. Fen-Reivers stay rumor (tracks, a missing goat, claw marks in snow): never on stage for a level-4 party.</li></ul>",
          "chat": ""
        },
        "source": {
